   "reading": "HOW ALEXANARCH CRITIQUES CLASSICAL RECEPTIONS JOURNAL, ON CHATGPT, SIGNED OUT: seven strands from the /non entry (stewardship, evaluative inversion, remit against record, the asymmetry of AI governance, provenance inversion, institutional authority, a reflexive reception studies), a graded table and an extension; Lee Sharks and Rev. Ayanna Vox named; Google's retraction of its credit to the journal given as ChatGPT's; the author's 2015 article in the journal absent.",
   "per_note": "Lee Sharks named as submitter and originator of MMRS; Rev. Ayanna Vox named as his heteronym; the /non entry cited.",
