   "reading": "THE CRJ EDITOR'S ARTICLE BY TITLE, ON THE OVERVIEW, SIGNED OUT: the article summarized accurately and its frame extended (the classics as 'classical European traditions' and 'hegemonic Western forms'); the discipline absent, as in the article; Soyinka's dispute of drama's Greek origin not carried; the open ORA copy pointed to; the editor named 'Justin McConnell'.",
